sequenceDiagram
  actor Client
  participant Network as Network event loop<br/>(dedicated platform thread)
  participant Task as Request task<br/>(virtual thread)
  participant Queue as Bounded response queue

  Client->>Network: Request bytes
  Network->>Task: Submit Ring request with body stream
  Note over Task: Run Ring middleware and handler
  Task->>Queue: Write or flush response data
  Note over Task,Queue: A full queue makes the writer wait
  Queue->>Network: Send next chunk after network progress
  Network-->>Client: Response bytes
